# Membership bodies CRM

Use this when researching, scoring, ranking, or adding UK membership bodies in Notion. Do not use it for Tally copy, Gmail drafts, or Surveyor code. Outreach letter copy lives in `brand.mdc`.

This rule replaces the old Notion skill. Do not load that page as a skill.

